        dcterms:description "Pass 2 remediation addresses all v1 audit items. Empirical divergence alpha_emp=134.1 deg (Vogel-fit inversion) lies within 4 deg of golden angle; verdict supported in result.json. Overall 81.4/100 (faithfulness 80.4, reproducibility 83.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 80, Morphometric validation 77, Source and data traceability 85, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 84. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_033_on_leaf_arrangement_or_phyllot_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-033_on-leaf-arrangement-or-phyllotaxis.py at f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4, image/png, 1185844 B, 1800×1500 px, artifact_sha256 a41a664a49552536ae6c4c7f77c45a3410e1f17c5c7dd91e9396cc140957071b (sha256 a41a664a49552536ae6c4c7f77c45a3410e1f17c5c7dd91e9396cc140957071b), spec_fingerprint 76e623bd0fb2355aebb0e2e097002b099b16ff9048a213066b74c6c94c38eddc. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 76e623bd0fb2355aebb0e2e097002b099b16ff9048a213066b74c6c94c38eddc; artifact_sha256: a41a664a49552536ae6c4c7f77c45a3410e1f17c5c7dd91e9396cc140957071b; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-033/helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg=c76483eea3e564fe..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-033/paper_citations.bib=37c65304ef58f6d6..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-033/t1917_033_on_leaf_arrangement_or_phyllot_reference.json=a83fc6bfda2f2469...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-28-t1917-033-on-leaf-arrangement-or-phyllot-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) golden angle ~137.5 deg, rational convergents, Fibonacci parastichies; reconstructed_in_script: DoG segmentation, Vogel-fit alpha inversion (134-139 deg scan), rational sweep, ablation, KS golden vs 120 deg, rising (21,34)->(34,55) cascade; does_not_claim: Does not re-digitize Thompson